  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKRAINE: Help beyond Borders!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine is facing a violent conflict against the Russian Federation since February 2022. The centre &quot;The House of Mercy&quot;, that previously hosted 100 children with disability, has been evacuated due to the war. Now it is hosting hundreds of displaced people that need immediate assistance. Thanks to this project Aleimar and Fondazione Don Gnocchi want to provide emergency medication, first aid kits and humanitarian aid that will be fundamental to save their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
